<div class="content-wrapper"><div class="content-header"><div class="container-fluid"><h1><i class="fas fa-satellite-dish mr-2"></i>Panel SUNAT</h1><p class="text-muted">Estado y archivos de facturas, boletas y notas de credito.</p></div></div><div class="content"><div class="container-fluid">
<div class="card card-outline card-primary"><div class="card-body"><form id="sunat-filters" class="form-row align-items-end"><div class="form-group col-md-3"><label>Desde</label><input type="date" name="date_from" class="form-control"></div><div class="form-group col-md-3"><label>Hasta</label><input type="date" name="date_to" class="form-control"></div><div class="form-group col-md-2"><label>Documento</label><select name="document_type" class="form-control"><option value="">Todos</option><option value="invoice">Facturas</option><option value="receipt">Boletas</option><option value="credit-note">Notas de credito</option></select></div><div class="form-group col-md-2"><label>Estado</label><select name="status" class="form-control"><option value="">Todos</option><option value="accepted">Aceptados</option><option value="observed">Objetados</option><option value="rejected">Rechazados</option><option value="pending">Pendientes</option><option value="technical_error">Error tecnico</option><option value="internal">Serie interna</option></select></div><div class="form-group col-md-2"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit"><i class="fas fa-filter"></i> Filtrar</button></div></form><small class="text-muted">Por defecto se muestran los ultimos 30 dias.</small></div></div>
<div class="row" id="sunat-summary"></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between"><h3 class="card-title">Documentos de venta</h3><button id="sunat-refresh" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary ml-auto"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Actualizar</button></div><div class="card-body"><div class="table-responsive"><table id="sunat-documents" class="table table-sm table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Documento</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Total</th><th>Estado</th><th>Respuesta</th><th>Fecha</th><th>Archivos</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Series electronicas e internas</h3></div><div class="card-body"><p class="text-muted">Una serie interna nunca se envia a SUNAT. Las series SUNAT deben respetar el formato fiscal.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table id="sunat-series" class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Serie</th><th>Siguiente</th><th>Destino</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
